# expiry4 — GETEX: sliding expiration
#
# Learn: a "sliding" session expires 30 minutes after the LAST request,
# so every read should also push the expiry out. GETEX key EX seconds
# returns the value and resets the TTL in one atomic command (GETEX key
# PERSIST removes it instead).
#
# Task: read session:9f2c and refresh its TTL to 1800 seconds using ONE
# command. The check expects the session's value as the only output.
#

GET session:9f2c
